  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Tank Barnes.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v03.wav",
   "d": 1.913,
   "e": "000000005nrxytg8qzzzwrmgbbnn600000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "TANK"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "Coach! This ain't—this is a study guide. It's… edible notes.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v05.wav",
   "d": 3.7,
   "e": "00pzupztzuuorrswtvupite0rxtwutjbb0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "You are consuming unauthorized carbohydrate philosophy.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v06.wav",
   "d": 4.738,
   "e": "0006rzfruvrl0lzzrlpol8rtmsms8nsrld000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The coach is a chrome robot. He teaches Plato's three parts of the soul: Reason leads, Spirit backs it up, and Appetite sits down.",
   "see": [
    "a robot walking",
    "a teacher pointing at a blackboard"
   ],
   "mood": "tension and suspense",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v07.wav",
   "d": 9.625,
   "e": "0yxyyzwh0xxvxwxwtwxmhzzyrkzuvx0vwytsxi00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/fa46dcdd-84b9-5716-9660-3855f719e66f/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/7618799e-6153-5957-aa50-a78dc6471eb6.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 10.16,
     "src": "The Green Promise",
     "y": 1949,
     "q": "a robot walking",
     "fit": 0.259
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/automotive-service/clips/0000465332-0000473373.mp4",
     "in": 3.5,
     "dur": 8.04,
     "src": "Automotive Service",
     "y": 1940,
     "q": "a teacher pointing at a blackboard",
     "fit": 0.392
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Tank Barnes, do you desire that sandwich?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v08.wav",
   "d": 3.388,
   "e": "0000dxyqqzzslkdkmotwzzuxltvvsngiq0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "No. Yes. It depends what \"desire\" means.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v09.wav",
   "d": 2.7,
   "e": "000pyzwzzmpgkvypvjpnxwursqlfcgb000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "everybody gets hungry, that's only natural",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/5944b49d-5679-52a7-8454-89ed1524e0dd/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/dde21cbc-e687-55e0-a1e9-7bd7547182fb.mp4",
   "in": 3.78,
   "d": 4.83,
   "said": "Without hunger, food would not be a reward even if he got it.",
   "src": "Motivation and Reward in Learning",
   "y": 1948
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A camera in the ceiling records every word. If appetite may rule in the cafeteria, the coach asks, why not on the field? Tank admits the cafeteria has rules too.",
   "see": [
    "a camera mounted on a ceiling",
    {
     "place": "p0b"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "tension and suspense",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v11.wav",
   "d": 11.975,
   "e": "jyxxyxvxxm0vvxzxvxuqxwsezxxo0yzrwywysw00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/f5408078-c02f-50f1-98c9-969ce231be93/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/7cd6914c-066d-598e-90b0-69c08edc86dd.mp4",
     "in": 6.875,
     "dur": 15.62,
     "src": "[Amateur film: Medicus collection: New York World's Fair, 1939-40] (Re",
     "y": 1939,
     "q": "a camera mounted on a ceiling",
     "fit": 0.325
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/caf7c05a-d370-5cd6-8332-28e64f1be4a5/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/8859744a-9404-530b-ae58-4b7b9c7847c9.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "Let's Be Good Citizens at School",
     "y": 1953,
     "q": "p0b"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Then you admit: you have placed your appetite above rule.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v12.wav",
   "d": 4.513,
   "e": "0003zyvzoys0000szxfzyqvtuptsrvotth100000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "I placed my appetite above bad food.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v13.wav",
   "d": 2.65,
   "e": "000lpnzzqzvxrooywpyudtxud8spm60000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "So you believe yourself qualified to judge what is \"bad.\" Are you Reason?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v14.wav",
   "d": 5.438,
   "e": "000ywzzwsyvgzrumpzuornxyg0000wppyti00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "No.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v15.wav",
   "d": 1.075,
   "e": "00000000bsvyzzzzyxrle9000000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Are you Spirit? The part of the soul that loves honor?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v16.wav",
   "d": 4.113,
   "e": "0000xtwxoztf000ptysruzztmtnsssszn5000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "I mean—yeah, I got spirit.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v17.wav",
   "d": 1.95,
   "e": "0000erwzzyzzzwwmxqnq0pvvqlf0000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "And yet you did not steal this sandwich for honor. You stole it for taste. Therefore, by elimination, you have acted as Appetite. Do you concede?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v18.wav",
   "d": 10.638,
   "e": "0tzzwvwvvtyd0wztvri0zxuttutwtrur00ntua00"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "…Yes.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v19.wav",
   "d": 1.175,
   "e": "00000001mpsyzzzywuqab8820000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "rules are rules, I suppose",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/school-rules-how-they-help-us/clips/0000257657-0000287654.mp4",
   "in": 15.08,
   "d": 4.19,
   "said": "Yes, most of the time we remember and respect the rules.",
   "src": "School Rules: How They Help Us",
   "y": 1953
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The camera records the concession. Tank will not be punished, the coach says. He will be educated, on the practice field.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p1a"
    },
    {
     "place": "p2a"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "ritual and ceremony",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v21.wav",
   "d": 8.45,
   "e": "0tzywxwxxvq0hyyvvyr4tzvxk0zzuvywvvttsd00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/d99bb7a7-97d2-5eed-bac5-068edf71eb70/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/bc4fb152-d4eb-5afd-9d44-08daa3dd3ff1.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "Friendship Seven",
     "y": 1962,
     "q": "p1a"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/4306bdcc-699b-538a-8cbe-cd91ea45b687/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/ba42fe74-81e2-5e2f-b775-63d18b776128.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "[Amateur films: Ivan Besse collection: Britton, South Dakota 1938-39] ",
     "y": 1938,
     "q": "p2a"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "You will run \"The Tripartite Ladder.\" Three hundred yards.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v22.wav",
   "d": 4.588,
   "e": "0008tvzzyrpttsttqrysb000mzvzpoxxe6t00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "What's that?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v23.wav",
   "d": 1.35,
   "e": "0000009tyzs8mhnzzxwuqmd00000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "First hundred: you run for Appetite. Second hundred: you run for Spirit. Third hundred: you run for Reason.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v24.wav",
   "d": 8.038,
   "e": "00ztztnzttpp00qyvtlwxtwx70yzxnamzonqg000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "How do I know which one I'm running for?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v25.wav",
   "d": 2.4,
   "e": "0000uzxzyyzxysphuvtsssrhdnspd70000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "You will know by how much it hurts.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v26.wav",
   "d": 2.788,
   "e": "000000gpwzszzwqrrmksspqql9ux84so00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The sandwich goes into a communal refrigerator marked The Good, to be shared out according to virtue.",
   "see": [
    "a man putting food in a refrigerator"
   ],
   "mood": "sorrow",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v27.wav",
   "d": 7.175,
   "e": "0wxyuuzywuxxuxyvoxxqxvd08zwyw3szwyxrk000",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/75ff5d47-b2f9-570d-b2ad-1a89c059a2a5/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/99cdf778-f2f8-5889-8b68-2df2315dd6f8.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 18.45,
     "src": "Speaking of Rubber (Part I)",
     "y": 1951,
     "q": "a man putting food in a refrigerator",
     "fit": 0.317
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TANK",
   "text": "Coach, please. It's turkey.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v28.wav",
   "d": 2.05,
   "e": "00001zzwh9eyzyqsrhhiwxr0knhe900000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "Turkey is a base appetite. So is \"please.\" Now move.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v29.wav",
   "d": 4.488,
   "e": "000pzpyxvxwuvrpvllzxqjzugk10lyvut8200000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "BRAWNDO BILL"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRAWNDO BILL",
   "text": "Coach! If I stop wanting sandwiches… will I throw more touchdowns?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v31.wav",
   "d": 4.6,
   "e": "00wzjuyqyqxtvrxxoihf00vzmuzzuhtkkcb00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "S.O.C.R.A.T.E.S.",
   "text": "No, Bill. But you will believe you will. And belief… is the first down of the Noble Lie.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep02/v32.wav",
   "d": 6.788,
   "e": "00mztzpqrrqonzt00rtuuh00ystwuwpqxrvl0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "if you believe you can do it, you can do it",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/survival-stresses/clips/0001300130-0001346410.mp4",
   "in": 7.36,
   "d": 2.95,
   "said": "Don't overestimate your strength.",
   "src": "Survival Stresses",
   "y": 1961
  },
  {
